{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix up your style with a customization collection that's sure to get townsfolk talking! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep things cute with additional hairstyles, or go full-on adorable with alpaca and chick costumes. Seeking something stealthy? This set includes ninja outfits, a ninja glider, and even ninja-themed bazaar customizations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional hairstyles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Braid &amp; Flowers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat Ear Buns with Highlights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short Perm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side Part with Highlights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal costumes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chick Costume Sets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alpaca Costume Sets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Set: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Outfit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Glider</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Bazaar Set</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*These items will appear in your dresser once you have accepted it from the mailbox in front of your house. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Outfits can be changed by using the mirror or dresser in your house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*You need to have progressed far enough through the game in order to use the glider and customize your bazaar stall.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3248040?t=1756846921","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3248040?t=1756846921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248040/65469345d7fe076cdacd731feafb236024215ec3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756846921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248040/65469345d7fe076